hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1001","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad-kardah, Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, aadmi us gunah ki wajah se rizq se mehroom kar diya jata hai jo woh karta hai."
"1002","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ke ba'z bande aise hain ke agar woh Allah ki qasam khaen (ke Allah kuch karega), to Allah yaqeenan un ki qasam poori farmata hai."
"1003","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne is jaisi hadees bayan ki."
"1004","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne is jaisi hadees bayan ki."
"1005","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ke ba'z bande aise hain jo logon ko un ki nishaniyon se pehchante hain."
"1006","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees ek doosri sanad se bhi Ibrahim bin Abdullah al-Mukharrami se un ki sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai lekin us mein Haddasana Sabit ki jagah An Sabit hai."
"1007","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ke bandon mein woh hain jinhen us ne logon ki hajat poori karne ke liye paida kiya hai; log apni hajat mein fikr-mand ho kar un ki taraf ruju' karte hain, aur yahi woh hain jo Roz-e-Qayamat mehfooz honge."
"1008","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ke bandon mein woh hain jinhen us ne logon ki hajat poori karne ke liye paida kiya hai; log tangi ke waqt un ki taraf ruju' karte hain, aur yahi woh hain jo Roz-e-Qayamat mehfooz honge."
"1009","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se daud ka muqabla kiya aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us se aage nikal gae. Musalman is par bahut khush hue. Phir us aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Allah ke Rasul! (Aao) dobara muqabla karein. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan. Pas Aap ne us se (dobara) muqabla kiya, aur woh aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aage nikal gaya. Yeh Nabi aur un ke sahaba ko napasand guzra. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ka tareeqa yahi hai ke woh jis cheez ko duniya mein buland karta hai, use past bhi karta hai."
"1010","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, khat ka jawab dena utna hi zaroori hai jitna salam ka jawab dena. Shaikh kehte hain: Us ki sanad qawi nahin."
"1011","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, isharon o kinayon mein baat karne mein jhoot se bachao hai."
"1012","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, jo behtareen cheez aadmi khata hai woh hai jo us ki apni kamayi se ho, aur us ki aulad bhi us ki apni kamayi se hai."
"1013","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Ali bin Abdul Aziz se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"1014","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hubshi bin Junadah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ek taweel hadees mein farmate suna: Beshak, mangna sirf us shakhs ke liye jaiz hai jo shadeed mohtaj ho ya jo qarz ke bojh tale daba ho."
"1015","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: Ilm. Us ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main aap se amal ke bare mein pooch raha hun, jabke aap mujhe ilm ke bare mein bata rahe hain? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, zyada ilm ke sath thoda amal kasrat hai, aur jahalat ke sath zyada amal qillat hai."
"1016","[AI-translation] Abu Zahriyah se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Mujhe afzal-tareen amal batayen. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Ilm ko lazim pakdo. Is par, us ne kaha: Main ne aap se afzal-tareen amal ke bare mein poocha hai? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Ilm ko lazim pakdo, kyunke zyada ilm ke sath thoda amal bhi kasrat hai, aur jahalat ke sath zyada amal qillat hai. Yeh riwayat ek doosri sanad se bhi marwi hai."
"1017","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, banda (husn-e-khuluq ki wajah se) roza-dar aur shab-bedari karne wale ka darja pata hai, jo din bhar roza rakhta hai aur saari raat (namaz mein) khada rehta hai."
"1018","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har deen ki ek khusoosiyat hoti hai, aur beshak is deen ki khusoosiyat haya hai."
"1019","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Talhah bin Rukanah ne use marfoo'an riwayat kiya, aur us mein hai: Beshak, har deen ki ek khusoosiyat hoti hai, aur Islam ki khusoosiyat haya hai."
"1020","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ki ek izzat hoti hai, aur beshak sab se izzat wali majlis woh hai jis se Qible ki taraf mutawajjeh hua jae."
"1021","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ki ek izzat hoti hai, aur beshak sab se izzat wali majlis woh hai jis se Qible ki taraf mutawajjeh hua jae, aur beshak tumhari majlisein amanat ke sath munaqid honi chahiye."
"1022","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Iyaz (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, har ummat ki ek aazmayish hoti hai, aur beshak meri ummat ki aazmayish maal hai."
"1023","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Iyaz (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1024","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, har ummat ki ek aazmayish hoti hai, aur beshak meri ummat ki aazmayish maal hai."
"1025","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef lae. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masjid ke darwaze ki donon chaukhaton ko pakda aur buland awaz se pukara: Ae logo! Ae ehl-e-Islam! Maut aayi jis ke sath us ne aana tha, woh Allah ke doston ke liye, jo Darus-Suroor walon mein se hain jin ki koshish aur raghbat us mein rehne ki hai, rahat o rahmat aur mubarak wapsi ke sath aayi. Ae logo! Ae ehl-e-Islam! Maut aayi jis cheez ke sath us ne aana tha woh shaitan ke doston ke liye, jo Darul-Ghuroor walon mein se hain jin ki koshish aur raghbat us mein rehne ki hai, afsos pachtawa aur ghatne wali wapsi ke sath aayi. Suno! Har koshan rehne wale ki ek hadd hoti hai aur har koshan rehne wale ki hadd maut hai."
"1026","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne ek hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi mazkoor tha: Beshak, har amal karne wale ke liye josh (amal mein) hota hai, aur har josh ke liye susti ka waqfa hota hai."
"1027","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kuch aazad-kardah thay jo musalsal roze rakhte aur raat mein namaz mein khade rehte thay. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ka zikr kiya gaya, pas Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, har amal karne wale ke liye josh hota hai, phir us josh ke liye susti ka waqfa hota hai."
"1028","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae jab Aap tek lagaye hue thay. Unhon ne kaha: Mu'az! Tum ne kis halat mein subah ki? Unhon ne jawab diya: Main ne Allah par iman ke sath subah ki. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak, har qaul ki ek tasdeeq hoti hai aur har haq ki ek haqeeqat hoti hai. Aur unhon ne ek taweel hadees bayan ki."
"1029","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har badshah ki ek mehfooz charagah hoti hai, aur beshak Allah ki mehfooz charagah woh hai jise us ne haram qaraar diya hai."
"1030","[AI-translation] Aamir Sha'bi kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) ko yeh kehte suna, aur unhon ne ek taweel hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi mazkoor tha: Suno! Har badshah ki ek makhsoos panah-gah hoti hai. Suno! Allah ki makhsoos panah-gah woh hai jise us ne haram qaraar diya hai."
"1031","[AI-translation] Haris bin Ubaidah kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har roza-dar ki ek (maqbool) dua hoti hai, aur jab woh iftar ka irada kare, to use apne pehle luqme ke waqt yeh dua padhni chahiye: Ae wasee' maghfirat wale! Mujhe bakhsh de."
"1032","[AI-translation] Zamrah bin Habib kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ka ek darwaza hota hai, aur beshak ibadat ka darwaza roza hai."
"1033","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu), Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se, jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ki ek kaan hoti hai, aur taqwe ki kaan ehl-e-ma'rifat ke dil hain."
"1034","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah apne walid (Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar, Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain jinhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ki ek kaan hoti hai, aur taqwe ki kaan ehl-e-ma'rifat ke dil hain."
"1035","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ka ek dil hota hai, aur beshak Quran ka dil Surah Yaseen hai. Pas jo Surah Yaseen padhe, us ke liye, us ke padhne ki wajah se, Quran dus martaba padhne ka sawab likha jayega."
"1036","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har cheez ka ek dil hota hai, aur beshak Quran ka dil Surah Yaseen hai. Jo Surah Yaseen Allah ki raza chahte hue padhe Allah us ki maghfirat farma dega aur use itna ajar milega ke goya us ne barah martaba mukammal Quran padha ho aur jis Musalman ke paas Malkul Maut ke nuzool ke waqt Surah Yaseen padhi jae to us ke paas us surat ke har harf ke badle dus farishte nazil honge jo us ke samne saf bandhe khade honge us par durood bhejenge, us ke liye istighfar karenge, us ke ghusl ke waqt maujood rahenge, us ke janaze ke sath chalenge, namaz-e-janaza padhenge, us ke dafan ka mushahida karenge. Aur jis Musalman ne sakaratul-maut mein Surah Yaseen padhi, Malkul Maut us ki rooh qabz nahin karega yahan tak ke Jannat ka darogha, Rizwan, us ke liye Jannat ka mashroob layega, jo woh apne bistar par hote hue piyega. Phir Malkul Maut us ki rooh qabz karega jab woh sair hoga, aur woh apni qabr mein sair rahega, aur Roz-e-Qayamat sair ki halat mein uthaya jayega, aur use mu'azzaz ambiya (Alaihimussalam) ke hauzon mein se kisi ki hajat nahin hogi yahan tak ke woh Jannat mein dakhil ho, aur woh sair hoga."
"1037","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har Nabi ki ek (maqbool) dua hoti hai. Aur beshak, main ne apni dua Roz-e-Qayamat apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye chhupa rakhi hai. Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1038","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai jo woh apni ummat ke liye karta hai, aur beshak main ne apni dua Roz-e-Qayamat apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye chhupa rakhi hai."
"1039","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai, aur main, agar Allah chahe, apni dua Roz-e-Qayamat apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye chhupane ka irada rakhta hun. Ibn Marzuq ki riwayat mein alfaz hain har Nabi ke liye."
"1040","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Ka'b al-Ahbar se kaha: Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai jo woh karta hai, lekin main Roz-e-Qayamat apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye apni dua chhupane ka irada rakhta hun. Pas Ka'b ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya tum ne yeh hadees Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai? Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jawab diya: Haan."
"1041","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai jo, jab woh use karta hai, qabool hoti hai, aur main aakhirat mein apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye apni dua mehfooz rakhne ka irada rakhta hun."
"1042","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai, aur main, insha'Allah, apni dua apni ummat ke liye shafa'at karne ke liye chhupa kar rakhne ka irada rakhta hun."
"1043","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai jo woh apni ummat ke liye karta hai, aur beshak main ne apni ummat ki taraf se shafa'at ke liye apni dua chhupa rakhi hai."
"1044","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai jo woh karta hai, aur beshak main ne Roz-e-Qayamat apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye apni dua mehfooz rakhi hai."
"1045","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hoti hai, aur main, insha'Allah, apni dua chhupa kar rakhne ka irada rakhta hun taake main Roz-e-Qayamat apni ummat ke liye shafa'at kar sakun."
"1046","[AI-translation] Arsi kehte hain ke hum Hazrat Khabbab (Raziyallahu anhu) ki iyadat ke liye gae jab woh beemar thay, aur un ke ghar mein ek deewar banayi ja rahi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, momin ko us ke har kharch par ajar diya jata hai sawae us ke jo woh mitti ya imarat par kharch kare."
"1047","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Ka'b bin Malik apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! She'r ke bare mein aap ki kya rae hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, momin apni talwar aur apni zaban se jihad karta hai. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, goya woh unhen nezon se (hajv ke zariye) marta hai."
"1048","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, hasad nekiyon ko kha jata hai jaise aag lakdi ko kha jati hai."
"1049","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, hasad nekiyon ko kha jata hai jaise aag lakdi ko kha jati hai."
"1050","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho kaun si cheez aksar logon ko Jahannam mein dakhil karegi? Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne kaha: Allah aur us ka Rasul behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, woh cheez jo aksar logon ko Jahannam mein dakhil karegi woh do khokhli cheezein hain: munh aur sharmgah. Kya tum jante ho kaun si cheez aksar logon ko Jannat mein dakhil karegi? Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne kaha: Allah aur us ka Rasul behtar jante hain. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, woh cheez jo aksar logon ko Jannat mein dakhil karegi woh Allah ka khauf aur husn-e-khuluq hai."
"1051","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, deen ajnabi ke taur par shuru hua, aur jald woh ajnabi ho jayega jaise shuru mein tha, pas ghuraba ko khush-khabri ho."
"1052","[AI-translation] Kaseer bin Abdullah Muzani apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, deen ajnabi ke taur par shuru hua, aur jald woh ajnabi ho jayega jaise shuru mein tha, pas ghuraba ko khush-khabri ho. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Ghuraba kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jo meri sunnat ko zinda karte hain aur use Allah ke bandon ko sikhate hain."
"1053","[AI-translation] Kaseer bin Abdullah apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Islam ajnabi ke taur par shuru hua, aur jald woh dobara ajnabi ho jayega jaise shuru mein tha, pas ghuraba ko khush-khabri ho. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Ghuraba kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jo meri sunnat ko zinda karenge aur use Allah ke bandon ko sikhayenge."
"1054","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam ajnabi ke taur par shuru hua, aur jald woh ajnabi ho jayega jaise shuru mein tha, pas ghuraba ko khush-khabri ho."
"1055","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Islam ajnabi ke taur par shuru hua, aur jald woh ajnabi ho jayega jaise shuru mein tha, pas ghuraba ko khush-khabri ho. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Ghuraba kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jo (sunnaton ki) islah karenge jab log unhen bigaad dein."
"1056","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ek fitna uthega jo bandon ko jad se ukhaad dega, lekin aalim us se apne ilm ki wajah se nijat payega."
"1057","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, buri nazar aadmi ko qabr mein aur oont ko degchi mein dakhil kar deti hai."
"1058","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Shu'aib se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi us ki sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1059","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, yaqeenan buri nazar aadmi ko qabr mein aur oont ko degchi mein dakhil kar deti hai."
"1060","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, jo takabbur se apna libas ghaseete, to Roz-e-Qayamat Allah Ta'ala us ki taraf dekhega bhi nahin. Aur Abu Muhammad se Abdullah bin Dinar ki riwayat mein, (Hazrat Ibn Umar, Raziyallahu anhu ke bajae) Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) hain."
"1061","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, jo takabbur se apna libas ghaseete, Allah Ta'ala Roz-e-Qayamat us ki taraf dekhega bhi nahin. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1062","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, jo takabbur se apna libas ghaseete, Allah Roz-e-Qayamat us ki taraf dekhega bhi nahin."
"1063","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah har mu'amle mein narmi ko pasand farmata hai."
"1064","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1065","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Yahudiyon ka ek giroh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki aur kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aishah! Beshak, Allah har mu'amle mein narmi ko pasand farmata hai."
"1066","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah har mu'amle mein narmi ko pasand farmata hai. Imam Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath Imam Zuhri se un ki sanad ke sath isi tarah riwayat kiya hai."
"1067","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah khoobsurat hai aur khoobsurati ko pasand farmata hai, aur woh yeh bhi pasand farmata hai ke apne bande par apni nemat ka asar dekhe, aur woh tangi aur faqr zahir karne ko napasand farmata hai."
"1068","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Saeed bin Kaseer bin Afeer apne walid Saeed se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah khoobsurat hai aur khoobsurati ko pasand farmata hai. Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath hamare aaqa Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai, jinhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne use mukhtasar taur par bayan kiya hai."
"1069","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah un ko pasand farmata hai jo dua mein lage rehte hain."
"1070","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Kaseer bin Ubaid se bhi ek doosri sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai, aur us mein Anin Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam hai."
"1071","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) (ek din) Masjid-e-Nabawi ki taraf gae aur dekha ke Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qabr par ro rahe thay. Unhon ne kaha: Mu'az! Tum kyun ro rahe ho? Unhon ne jawab diya: Mujhe woh rulata hai jo main ne is qabr wale se suna hai. Main ne unhen farmate suna: Beshak, Allah nek, gum-nam, muttaqi logon ko pasand farmata hai jo, majlison se ghayib hon to talash na kiye jayen, aur hazir hon to pehchane ya pukare na jayen (halanke) un ke dil hidayat ke chiragh hain; woh har ghubar-aalood, andheri aazmayish se salamati ke sath nikalte hain."
"1072","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah us momin bande ko pasand farmata hai jo rozi kamata hai."
"1073","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala us ko pasand farmata hai jo pesha ikhtiyar kare."
"1074","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat un alfaz ke sath ek doosri sanad se marwi hai: Beshak, Allah us momin bande ko pasand farmata hai jo pesha ikhtiyar kare."
"1075","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah har ghamgeen dil ko pasand farmata hai."
"1076","[AI-translation] Hazrat Husain bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah buland o aala a'mal ko pasand farmata hai, aur past a'mal ko napasand farmata hai."
"1077","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah Azza wa Jalla buland o shareef akhlaq ko pasand farmata hai aur past akhlaq ko napasand farmata hai."
"1078","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah pasand farmata hai ke us ki rukhsat qabool ki jae jaise woh pasand farmata hai ke us ki na-farmani chhodi jae."
"1079","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah Ta'ala pasand farmata hai ke us ki (di hui) rukhsat qabool ki jae jaise woh pasand farmata hai ke us ke pakke ehkamat qabool kiye jayen. Woh kehti hain: Main ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Us ke pakke ehkamat kaun se hain? Aap ne farmaya: Us ke faraiz."
"1080","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne meri pagdi ka sira pakda aur farmaya: Ae Imran! Beshak Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala kharch karne ko pasand farmata hai aur rokne ko pasand nahin farmata, pas kharch karo aur sakhi bano, aur apni thaili ka munh bandh kar na rakho, warna (rizq) talab karna tumhare liye mushkil ho jayega. Aur jaan lo ke beshak Allah khwahishat ke waqt samajhdar aankh aur shakook ke nazil hone ke waqt kamil aql ko pasand farmata hai, aur woh sakhawat ko bhi pasand farmata hai agarche chand khajooron par ho, aur woh bahaduri ko bhi pasand farmata hai agarche saanp marne mein ho."
"1081","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne peeche se meri pagdi ka sira pakda phir farmaya: Ae Imran! Beshak, Allah kharch karne ko pasand farmata hai aur rokne ko pasand nahin farmata, pas (tum khud) khao aur (doosron ko bhi) khilao, aur apni thaili ka munh bandh kar na rakho, warna (rizq) talab karna tumhare liye mushkil ho jayega. Aur jaan lo ke beshak Allah khwahishat ke waqt samajhdar aankh aur shakook ke nazil hone ke waqt kamil aql ko pasand farmata hai, aur woh sakhawat ko bhi pasand farmata hai agarche chand khajooron par ho, aur woh bahaduri ko bhi pasand farmata hai agarche saanp marne mein ho."
"1082","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aswad bin Sari' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, tumhara Rabb tareefon ko pasand farmata hai. Rawi ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya hai."
"1083","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah narmi aur khush-akhlaqi ko pasand farmata hai."
"1084","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah narmi aur khush-akhlaqi ko pasand farmata hai."
"1085","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yaqeenan Allah apne bande ki tauba us waqt tak qabool farmata hai jab halaq mein ghargharahat shuru ho (yani, jab tak us par maut ki kafiyat tari na ho)."
"1086","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Abu Aasim Nahdi se marwi hai ke beshak Allah Ta'ala taqatwar shar-pasand shakhs ko napasand farmata hai jise us ke jism ya maal mein koi museebat nahin pohnchi."
"1087","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Abi Kaseer se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yaqeenan Allah ne tumhare liye namaz mein laghw a'mal, roze mein fohsh guftagu, aur qabron ke paas hansna napasand farmaya hai."
"1088","[AI-translation] Warrad kehte hain ke Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khat likha. Woh mujhe imla kara rahe thay aur main apne hath se likh raha tha ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah tumhen laghw guftagu, maal zaya karne, aur kasrat se sawal karne se mana farmata hai."
"1089","[AI-translation] Sha'bi kehte hain ke Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke katib ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khat likh kar kaha ke woh jo hadees unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai likh kar bhejen. Pas unhon ne unhen likha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, Allah ne tumhare liye teen cheezein napasand farmayi hain: Laghw guftagu, maal zaya karna, aur kasrat se sawal karna."
"1090","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir aur Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne tumhare liye kasrat se sawal karna, maal zaya karna, khud na dena aur doosron se lena, betiyon ko zinda dafnana, aur maan ki na-farmani napasand farmayi hai."
"1091","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ko Musalman ke liye ghairat hai, pas use (Musalman ko) bhi ghairat rakhni chahiye."
"1092","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Usman bin Abdullah se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"1093","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah apne bandon mein se sirf un par raham farmata hai jo raham-dil hain."
"1094","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah sadqe ki wajah se sattar buri mautein taal deta hai."
"1095","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah bande ko us gunah ki wajah se bhi nafa deta hai jo woh karta hai."
"1096","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Amr bin Muqarrin (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah is deen ki ek badkar shakhs ke zariye bhi madad farmayega."
"1097","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ghazwa-e-Khaibar mein shareek hue, aur unhon ne yeh hadees taweel bayan ki, aur us ke aakhir mein yeh alfaz thay: Sirf Musalman Jannat mein dakhil hoga, aur beshak Allah is deen ki ek badkar shakhs ke zariye bhi madad farmayega."
"1098","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah us bande se razi hota hai jo, jab khana khae ya mashroob piye, Allah ka us par shukr ada kare. Use Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai, aur us mein hai: Jo khana khae aur us (Allah) ka us par shukr ada kare, ya mashroob piye aur us (Allah) ka us par shukr ada kare."
"1099","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah us bande se razi hota hai jo, jab khana khae, Allah ka us par shukr ada kare, ya jab mashroob piye, Allah ka us par shukr ada kare."
"1100","[AI-translation] Abu Ahwas apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hue, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Beshak, jab Allah kisi bande par nemat farmata hai, woh pasand farmata hai ke us ka asar us par dekhe. Rawi ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya hai."
"1101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah pasand farmata hai ke apne bande par apni nemat ka asar dekhe, aur woh tangi aur faqr zahir karne ko napasand farmata hai."
"1102","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh ek reshi rumal odhe bahar nikle (is se pehle) un par is tarah ka (qeemti) kapda nahin dekha gaya tha un par e'teraz hua to unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande par in'am karta hai to woh yeh baat pasand karta hai ke us par apni nemat ka asar dekhe. Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Abdullah al-Hafiz kehte hain: Is shaikh (Mufazzal bin Fuzalah) se Shu'bah ne do hadeesein li hain aur hamare ilm mein Shu'bah ke siwa kisi ne un se riwayat nahin li, un ke aur Shu'bah ke darmiyan koi qareebi talluq nahin kyunke yeh (Shu'bah) Basri hain aur Mufazzal Hijazi hain aur yaqeen karen ke Shu'bah kayi (shuyookh) se riwayat karne mein munfarid hai, un (shuyookh) se Shu'bah ke siwa kisi ne riwayat nahin li."
"1103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ilm ko logon se chheen kar nahin uthayega, lekin woh ilm ko ulama ko (duniya se) utha kar uthayega."
"1104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki aur us mein kaha: Beshak, Allah ilm ko apne bandon se chheen kar nahin uthayega."
"1105","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Hisham se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi us ki sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1106","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Hisham se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi us ki sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1107","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ilm ko logon se chheen kar nahin uthayega, lekin woh ilm ko ulama ko (duniya se) utha kar uthayega. Phir, jab koi aalim baqi na rahega, log jahilon ko peshwa bana lenge; un se poocha jayega aur woh baghair ilm ke fatwe denge. Pas, woh khud gumrah honge aur doosron ko bhi gumrah karenge."
"1108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah aakhirat ki niyyat par duniya ata farmata hai, lekin woh duniya ki niyyat par aakhirat ata farmane se inkar farmata hai."
"1109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah aakhirat ki niyyat par duniya ata farmata hai, lekin woh duniya ki niyyat par aakhirat ata farmane se inkar farmata hai."
"1110","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman al-Farsi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah apne bande se haya farmata hai ke woh (banda) us ki taraf apne hath uthaye aur woh (Allah) unhen khali laotade."
"1111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman al-Farsi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, tumhara Rabb bahut haya wala aur sakhi hai. Woh apne bande se haya farmata hai jab woh us ki taraf apne hath uthaye ke unhen khali laotade."
"1112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne sari zameen mere liye masjid aur taharat ka zariya banayi hai."
"1113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah, ya unhon ne kaha: Beshak mera Rabb, mere liye zameen lapet di yahan tak ke main ne us ke mashriq o maghrib dekhe, aur beshak meri ummat ki saltanat wahan tak pohanchayegi jahan tak us ke liye lapeti gayi."
"1114","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne meri ummat ko un waswason par mu'af farmaya hai jo un ke dilon mein uthte hain, jab tak woh unhen zaban se na kahen ya un par amal na karen."
"1115","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne meri ummat ko un tamam cheezon par mu'af farmaya hai jo un ke dilon mein uthti hain jab tak woh unhen zaban se na kahen ya un par amal na karen. Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne meri ummat ko un tamam cheezon par mu'af farmaya hai jo un ke dilon mein uthti hain jab tak woh unhen zaban se na kahen ya un par amal na karen."
"1116","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne qana'at o yaqeen mein apne adl o insaf ke zariye aaram o khushi rakhi hai, jabke us ne shak o narazgi mein ranj o takleef rakhi hai. Rawi ko khushi ya aasani ke lafz mein shak hai (ke un donon mein se kaun sa lafz asal mein kaha gaya tha)."
"1117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah ne auraton par ghairat aur mardon par haya wajib farmayi hai. Pas un mein se jo sawab ki niyyat se sabr kare, us ke liye shaheed ke barabar ajar hai."
"1118","[AI-translation] Umar bin Zarr apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah har bolne wale ki zaban ke qareeb hai, pas bande ko Allah se darna chahiye aur dekhna chahiye ke woh kya keh raha hai."
"1119","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah Ta'ala bande ka amal qabool nahin farmata yahan tak ke woh us ki guftagu se razi ho."
"1120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, jab Allah Ta'ala kisi qaum ke sath bhalayi ka irada farmata hai, use aazmayish mein dalta hai."
"1121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, sab se bada ajar sab se badi aazmayish ke sath aata hai, aur beshak, jab Allah Azza wa Jalla kisi qaum se mohabbat farmata hai, use aazmayish mein dalta hai. Phir jo razi ho (aazmayish par), us ke liye raza hai, aur jo naraz ho, us ke liye narazgi hai."
"1122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Roz-e-Qayamat, logon mein sab se sakht azab us aalim ka hoga jis ka ilm use us mein se nafa na de jo Allah ne use ata farmaya tha."
"1123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, Roz-e-Qayamat Allah ke nazdeek badtareen shakhs woh hoga jis se log us ki fohsh guftagu ki wajah se milne se bachte hon. Is riwayat mein ek waqe'a hai jise main ne mukhtasar kiya hai."
"1124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hone ki ijazat mangi, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, yeh apne qabeelay ka bura aadmi hai. Phir jab woh andar aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khul kar bashashat ke sath us se baat ki, jab woh chala gaya to ek doosre aadmi ne ijazat mangi jab us ne ijazat mangi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh apne qabeelay ka achcha aadmi hai. Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain: Jab woh aadmi andar aaya to us se na to Aap ne khul kar baat ki jis tarah ke pehle se ki thi aur na is tarah bashashat se pesh aae. Kehti hain: Jab woh chala gaya to main ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Aap ne falan ke bare mein jo kaha so kaha, phir Aap ne us se khul kar bashashat se baat ki, aur Aap ne doosre ke bare mein jo kaha so kaha, lekin main ne Aap ko us se us tarah pesh aate nahin dekha? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aishah! Beshak, logon mein badtareen shakhs woh hai jis se log us ki bad-zabani ki wajah se bachte hon."
"1125","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, logon mein Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek badtareen shakhs woh hai jo doosre ki dunyawi zindagi ki khatir apni aakhirat barbad kare."
"1126","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, bad-bakhton mein sab se bada bad-bakht woh hai jis par duniya ka faqr aur aakhirat ka azab jama ho jayen. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1127","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, main apne baad apni ummat ke liye teen cheezon se darta hun: Aalim ki laghzish, zalim hukmaran, aur khwahishat ki pairwi."
"1128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, main tumhari kamrein pakad raha hun, tumhen (Jahannam mein girne se) rok raha hun, aur tum us mein gir rahe ho jaise patange aur barsati keede aag mein girte hain."
"1129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, main tumhari kamrein pakad raha hun, tumhen Jahannam ki aag se rok raha hun, aur tum us mein gir rahe ho jaise patange aur barsati keede aag mein girte hain."
"1130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, main tumhari kamrein pakad raha hun ke aag se pare hat jao lekin tum zabardasti us mein gir rahe ho jaise patange aur barsati keede (aag mein) girte hain. Qareeb hai ke tumhari kamrein chhod di jayen aur (suno) main Hauz-e-Kausar par tumhara pesh-rau hunga, wahan tum alag alag aur ikatthe ho kar aaoge, main tumhen tumhari nishaniyon aur namon se pehchan lunga jaise aadmi apne oonton mein se ajnabi oont ko (aasani se) pehchan leta hai aur tumhen bayen janib le jaya ja raha hoga main tumhare bare mein Rabbul Aalameen ki minnat samajat karte hue arz karunga: Ae mere Rabb! Yeh meri ummat hain, ae mere Rabb! Yeh meri ummat hain. Phir kaha jayega: Beshak, tum nahin jante tumhare baad unhon ne kya bid'atein nikali. Beshak, tumhare baad, woh barabar (deen se) ulte paon phirte rahe. (Suno!) Main tum mein se us shakhs ko zaroor pehchanunga jo Roz-e-Qayamat me-me karti bakri uthaye aayega, aur woh pukarega: Ae Muhammad! Ae Muhammad! Main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahin kar sakta; main ne (Allah ka paigham) pohancha diya tha. Aur main tum mein se us shakhs ko zaroor pehchanunga jo Roz-e-Qayamat dahadta oont uthaye aayega, aur woh pukarega: Ae Muhammad! Ae Muhammad! Lekin main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahin kar sakta; main ne (Allah ka paigham) pohancha diya tha. Aur main tum mein se us shakhs ko zaroor pehchanunga jo Roz-e-Qayamat hinhinata ghoda uthaye aayega, aur woh pukarega: Ae Muhammad! Ae Muhammad! Lekin main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahin kar sakta; main ne (Allah ka paigham) pohancha diya tha. Aur main tum mein se us shakhs ko zaroor pehchanunga jo Roz-e-Qayamat mashkeeza uthaye aayega, aur woh pukarega: Ae Muhammad! Ae Muhammad! Lekin main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahin kar sakta; main ne (Allah ka paigham) pohancha diya tha."
"1131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah us har cheez ke bare mein janta hai jise us ne haram qaraar diya hai ke yaqeenan tum mein se koi us mein dekhega. Khabardar! Beshak, main tumhari kamrein pakad raha hun taake tumhen aag mein girne se rokun (aur tum gir rahe ho) jaise patange aur barsati keede aag mein girte hain."
"1132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, meri aur tumhari misal us shakhs jaisi hai jis ne aag jalayi, aur jab us ne apne gird ko roshan kiya, patange aur doosri makhlooq jo aag mein girti hai us mein girne lagi. Pas main tumhen aag mein girne se rok raha hun tumhari kamrein pakad kar, lekin tum mere hathon se phisal kar us mein gir rahe ho."
"1133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiyah bin Humaidah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhari kamrein pakad raha hun, tumhen aag se bacha raha hun?"
"1134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, aur Ash'ari qabeelay ke do aadmi mere sath thay. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Musa! Ya Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Beshak, hum apne kaam par us ko muqarrar nahin karte jo use chahta ho."
"1135","[AI-translation] Abu Qatadah aur Abu Dahma kehte hain ke hum ek dehati aadmi ke paas aae, aur us ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera hath pakda aur mujhe woh cheezein sikhayin jo Allah Ta'ala ne unhen sikhayi thin. Pas un cheezon mein se jo main ne us se sun kar yaad rakhin, ek yeh thi: Beshak, jo bhi tum Allah ke khauf se chhodo, Allah tumhen us se behtar cheez ata farmayega."
"1136","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Humaid bin Hilal se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai, lekin us mein, yeh hadees Abu Qatadah aur Abu Bilal se marwi hai, aur unhon ne us aadmi ka naam bhi zikr kiya."
"1137","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Hilal ek aadmi se riwayat karte hain, jis ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, tumhare liye mimbar rakha gaya jis ke pae lohe ke thay, main ne woh yaad kiya jo tum ne mujhe sikhaya, tum ne kaha: Beshak, jo bhi tum Allah ki raza ke liye chhodo, Allah tumhen badle mein us se behtar cheez ata farmayega."
"1138","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Hilal us shakhs se riwayat karte hain jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha tha ya Aap se suna tha. Us ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, Aap khutba irshad farma rahe thay, main ne arz kiya: Allah ne jo Aap ko ilm ata farmaya hai us mein se mujhe bhi ta'leem farma deejiye. Aap (mimbar se) neeche tashreef lae aur Aap ke liye khajoor ki chhaal se bani hui ek kursi rakhi gayi jis ke pae lohe ke thay to Aap ne irshad farmaya: Beshak tu Allah se darr kar jis cheez ko chhodega Allah badle mein tujhe us ke siwa behtar cheez ata farmayega. Rifa'ah Adawi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, Aap khutba irshad farma rahe thay, main ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Main ajnabi hun, main Aap se deen ke bare mein poochne aaya hun, mujhe deen ke bare mein ilm nahin. Woh kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) (mimbar se) neeche tashreef lae, apna khutba qata' kiya, phir khajoor ki chhaal se bani hui lohe ke paon wali kursi layi gayi, aur woh mujhe woh sikhane lage jo Allah Ta'ala ne unhen sikhaya tha. Phir woh (dobara) apne khutbe ke liye mimbar par chadh gae."
"1139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hasan bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, apne Musalman bhai ko khush karna un a'mal mein se hai jo maghfirat ko wajib karte hain."
"1140","[AI-translation] Miqdam bin Shuraih apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Kaun sa amal hai jo mujhe Jannat mein dakhil karega? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, salam phailana aur achchi baatein karna un a'mal mein se hai jo maghfirat ko wajib karte hain."
"1141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, duniya bahut meethi aur hari-bhari hai, aur beshak Allah Ta'ala tumhen us mein khalifa banayega taake dekhe tum kaise amal karte ho. Lehaza, duniya se daro aur auraton se daro, aur zalim hukmaran ke samne haq baat se afzal koi baat nahin."
"1142","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein Asr ki namaz padhayi, phir Aap khutba dene ke liye khade hue. Apne khutbe mein, Aap ne farmaya: Suno! Beshak, duniya bahut meethi aur sar-sabz hai, aur beshak Allah tumhen us mein khalifa banayega taake dekhe tum kaise amal karte ho. Use Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai."
"1143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khaulah bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur hamare aaqa Hamzah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne duniya ke bare mein guftagu ki, pas Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, duniya bahut meethi aur hari-bhari hai, pas jo us mein se apni zaroorat ke mutabiq le, us ke liye us mein barkat rakhi jayegi."
"1144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umrah bint Haris bin Abi Zirar (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, duniya sar-sabz aur meethi hai, pas jo us ke halal hisse mein se kuch pae, to wahi cheez hai jis mein use barkat di jayegi. Aur kitne hi hain jo Allah Azza wa Jalla, aur us ke Rasul ke maal ka ghalat istemal karte hain; un ke liye, Roz-e-Qayamat, aag hai."
"1145","[AI-translation] Ali bin Rabah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Ibn Adam ke dil ki har wadi mein ek shakh hai. Pas jis ka dil har wadi ki taraf maail ho, Allah ko parwa nahin ke woh use kis wadi mein halak kare."
"1146","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... Beshak, meri ummat ki auraton mein sab se ba-barkat woh hai jis ka chehra khushgawar ho aur jis ka mahr kam ho."
"1147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, yeh deen bahut mazboot hai, pas us mein narmi se dakhil ho, aur apne nafs ko Allah ki ibadat se mutanaffir na karo, kyunke tez sawari daudane wala na (poora) zameen ka safar teh kar sakta hai aur na sawari ko zinda rehne deta hai."
"1148","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Abu Yahya se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi us ki sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, sunnat mein se hai ke aadmi apne mehman ko rukhsat karte waqt darwaze tak sath jae."
"1150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... (Unhon ne pehli hadees jaisi bayan ki.)"
"1151","[AI-translation] 1151 - Abdur Rahman bin Umar al-Bazzaz ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibnul A'rabi ne hamein bayan kiya, Ali bin Abdul Aziz ne hamein khabar di, Abu Ubaid ne hamein bayan kiya, Hushaim ne hamein bayan kiya, Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Zubaid al-Yami se, us se jis ne unhen Abdullah bin Masud se khabar di, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon ne farmaya: Beshak Ruhul Qudus ne mere dil mein phoonka ke koi jaan nahin maregi yahan tak ke apna rizq mukammal kar le, pas Allah se daro aur talab mein achche bano."
"1152","[AI-translation] 1152 - Abul Qasim Abdur Rahman bin Muhammad al-Udfuwi ne hamein khabar di, (unhon ne kaha): Abut Tayyib Ahmad bin Sulaiman al-Jurairi ne ijazat di, (unhon ne kaha): Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Jarir al-Tabari ne hamein bayan kiya, (unhon ne kaha): Ali bin Sahl al-Ramli ne mujhe bayan kiya, (unhon ne kaha): Hajjaj, yani Ibn Muhammad ne hamein bayan kiya, (unhon ne kaha): Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Abuz Zubair ne kaha: Jabir ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo, beshak tum mein se koi nahin marega yahan tak ke apna rizq mukammal kar le, aur rizq ko sust na samjho, aur Allah se daro, aur talab mein achche bano, aur jo halal ho woh lo aur jo haram ho woh chhod do."
"1153","[AI-translation] 1153 - Abu Muhammad Abdur Rahman bin Ahmad bin Hakim al-Uruzzi ne hamein khabar di, Ismail bin Ya'qub bin al-Jirab ne hamein bayan kiya, Mu'az bin al-Musanna ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Maslamah al-Qa'nabi ne hamein bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein bayan kiya, Mansur se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Abu Masud se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon ne farmaya: Beshak jo logon ne pehli nabuwwat ke kalam se paya us mein se: Jab tum haya na karo to jo chahe karo."
"1154","[AI-translation] 1154 - Aur main Abul Hasan Ali bin Musa al-Simsar hun, (jinhon ne kaha): Mujhe Abu Zaid ne bataya, jinhon ne kaha: Mujhe al-Farabri ne bataya, jinhon ne kaha: Mujhe al-Bukhari ne bataya, jinhon ne kaha: Adam ne hamein bayan kiya, jinhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hamein bayan kiya, Mansur se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rib'i bin Hirash ko Abu Masud se bayan karte suna, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo logon ne nabuwwat ke kalam se paya: Jab tum haya na karo to jo chahe karo."
"1155","[AI-translation] 1155 - Aur Abu Muhammad al-Tujibi se riwayat hai, hamein Ibn Jami' ne bayan kiya, hamein Ali bin Abdul Aziz ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah bin Maslamah al-Qa'nabi ne bayan kiya, un ki sanad ke sath, usi ki misl."
"1156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, jo logon ne pehli nabuwwat ke kalam se paya us mein se yeh hai: Agar tum haya mehsoos na karo, to jo chahe karo."
"1157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, (haqeeqi) aabid Badshah ke darwaze par dastak deta hai, aur yeh haqeeqat hai ke jo musalsal darwaze par dastak deta hai, qareeb hai ke woh us ke liye khol diya jae."
"1158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, namaz mein mashghooliyat hoti hai."
"1159","[AI-translation] Ibn Aishah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba dete hue farmaya: Beshak, mere Rabb ne mujhe hukm diya hai ke meri guftagu zikr ho, meri khamoshi fikr ho, aur meri nazar ibrat ka zariya ho."
"1160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main sirf rahmat bana kar bheja gaya hun (Allah Ta'ala ki taraf se)."
"1161","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat A'sham se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosre tareeq se bhi isi tarah marwi hai, aur us mein hai: Ae logo! Main rahmat bana kar bheja gaya hun (Allah Ta'ala ki taraf se)."
"1162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, (masle ke bare mein) poochna jahalat ki dawa hai."
"1163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur unhon ne yeh hadees tafseel se bayan ki, aur us mein yeh bhi tha ke yeh mu'amla Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pohancha, pas Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Unhon ne use qatl kar diya, Allah unhen halak kare! Jab woh hukm nahin jante thay, unhon ne poocha kyun nahin? Yaqeenan, poochna jahalat ki dawa hai."
"1164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek martaba Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein tashreef farma thay aur Aap ke sahaba Aap ko ghere hue thay ke achanak Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) aae aur aa kar khade ho gae, salam kiya phir baithne ke liye munasib jagah dekhne lage to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sahaba ke chehron ko dekhne lage ke kaun un ke liye wus'at paida karta hai. Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dayen janib baithe thay woh apni jagah se hate aur kaha: Abul Hasan! Aap yahan baith jayen, chunache woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke darmiyan baith gae. Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke chehre par khushi dekhi, phir Aap Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Abu Bakr! Sirf ehl-e-fazl fazl walon ke rutbe ko pehchante hain."
"1165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe sirf aala akhlaq ko mukammal karne ke liye bheja gaya hai."
"1166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe apni ummat ke liye gumrah sardaron se darr hai."
"1167","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: A'mal ka anjam us ke khatme par hai."
"1168","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Hazrat Sahl (Raziyallahu anhu) se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"1169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam ya to todi jati hai ya us par sharminda hona padta hai."
"1170","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam ya to todi jati hai ya us par sharminda hona padta hai. Tabarani ne kaha: Sirf Abu Muawiyah ne use Bashar se riwayat kiya hai, aur hamein Bashar ki is ke siwa koi doosri musnad hadees yaad nahin."
"1171","[AI-translation] Alqamah bin Waqas kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: A'mal niyyaton par hain. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1172","[AI-translation] Alqamah bin Waqas kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1173","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tamam a'mal ka daromadar niyyaton par hai, aur har insan ke liye wahi hai jis ki us ne niyyat ki. Pas, jis ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasul ki taraf ho, to us ki hijrat waqa'i Allah aur us ke Rasul ki taraf hai. Aur jis ki hijrat duniya ke husool ya kisi aurat se nikah ki gharz se ho, to us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki."
"1174","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar mili ke Banu Amr bin Auf mein kuch ikhtilaf tha. Phir unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki, aur us mein yeh bhi tha ke: Taliyan bajana auraton ke liye hai."
"1175","[AI-translation] Abu Abd Rabb al-Izzat kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Muawiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko mimbar par kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya mein sirf aazmayish o fitna baqi hai, aur tumhare har amal ki misal bartam jaisi hai, agar us ka oopri hissa (us ke mashroob ka) pak ho, to us ka nichla hissa bhi pak hoga, aur agar us ka oopri hissa napak ho, to us ka nichla hissa bhi napak hoga."
"1176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Raza'at sirf bhook ki wajah se doodh peene se (sabit) hoti hai. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1177","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Ash'as se ek doosri sanad ke sath marwi hai; unhon ne use bayan kiya, aur us mein hai (alfaz): Aishah! Yaqeeni banao ke tumhare (doodh ke) bhai kaun hain, kyunke raza'at (sabit) bhook mein doodh peene se hoti hai."
"1178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, yeh dil zang-aalood ho jate hain jaise loha zang-aalood hota hai. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Us ki jila (chamkane ka zariya) kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kasrat se maut ko yaad karna aur Quran ki tilawat."
"1179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, yeh dil zang-aalood ho jate hain jaise loha zang-aalood hota hai. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Us ki jila (chamkane ka zariya) kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Quran ki tilawat."
"1180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujh par sahara liye masjid mein dakhil hue aur farma rahe thay: Tum mein se kaun khush hoga ke Allah use Jahannam ki bhaap se bachae? Phir farmaya: Suno! Beshak, Jannat ke a'mal sakht o buland dushwariyon se ghere hue hain. Aap ne yeh teen martaba farmaya. (Phir farmaya:) Suno! Beshak, Jahannam ke a'mal, ya Aap ne farmaya, duniya ke a'mal aasan lazzaton aur khwahishat se ghere hue hain."
"1181","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, nazrein aur qasmein ya to todi jati hain ya un par sharminda hona padta hai."
"1182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabar barah-e-rast mushahide jaisi nahin."
"1183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabar barah-e-rast mushahide jaisi nahin."
"1184","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Hushaim se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai. Yahya bin Hassan kehte hain ke Hushaim ne yeh hadees nahin suni."
"1185","[AI-translation] Bahz bin Hakeem apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fasiq ki gheebat nahin hoti."
"1186","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Ja'd bin Yahya se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"1187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zalim ka rishtedari ka koi haq nahin."
"1188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khushamad momin ke akhlaq mein nahin payi jati."
"1189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba dete hue farmaya: Maut ke baad tauba ka mauqa nahin."
"1190","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Bakhshish mangne ke sath koi kabeera gunah baqi nahin rehta, aur israr ke sath koi sagheera gunah sagheer baqi nahin rehta."
"1191","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo humare siwa kisi ki mushabehat ikhtiyar kare woh hum mein se nahin, aur Yahud o Nasara ki mushabehat ikhtiyar na karo. Yahudiyon ka salam ungliyon se ishara karna hai, jabke Nasraniyon ka salam hatheliyon se ishara karna hai."
"1192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh hum mein se nahin jise Allah ne (mali) kushadgi ata farmayi, lekin woh apne ghar walon par bukhl kare, jabke (us ke ghar wale) hamsayon se khushbu sunghte hon, lekin hamsaye samajhte hon ke unhen kapda pehnaya ja raha hai, halanke unhen kapda nahin pehnaya ja raha hota."
"1193","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
"1194","[AI-translation] 1194 - Aur main Abu Muhammad Abdur Rahman bin Umar al-Tujibi hun, (unhon ne kaha): Mujhe Abul Abbas Ahmad bin Ibrahim bin Jami' al-Sukkari ne bataya, unhen padh kar sunate hue, (unhon ne kaha): Mujhe Ali bin Abdul Aziz al-Baghdadi ne bataya, unhen padh kar sunate hue, (unhon ne kaha): Mujhe Ishaq bin Ismail ne bataya, (unhon ne kaha): Mujhe Sufyan ne bataya, Amr bin Dinar se, Ubaidullah bin Abi Nahik se, Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin. Abul Hasan Ali bin Abdul Aziz ne kaha: Aur yeh hadees Waki' ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Abdullah bin al-Sa'ib se, Sa'd se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki. Aur use Waki' ne bhi riwayat kiya, (unhon ne kaha): Mujhe Sa'id bin Hassan al-Makhzumi ne bataya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Ubaidullah bin Abi Nahik se, Sa'd se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
"1195","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Naheek kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees is tarah bayan karte suna."
"1196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin. Imam Lais ne yeh hadees Misr mein us riwayat ke khilaf bayan ki jo Iraq mein marwi thi."
"1197","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Abi Saeed se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
"1198","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Sa'ib bin Naheek kehte hain ke main Hazrat Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf gaya unhon ne kaha: Bhatije! Tum kaun ho? Jab main ne unhen bataya, unhon ne kaha: Khush-aamdeed, tum kamayi karne wale tajir ho. Tum Quran ki qira'at kaisi karte ho? Main ne kaha: Achchi (qira'at karta hun) unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna hai: Quran padho aur roya karo, agar rona na aae to rone wali soorat bana liya karo aur Quran ko khush-ilhani se padho kyunke jis ne Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padha ya use khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
"1199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
"1200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
